Package: FDBAH
Type: Package
Title: Adaptive Initial Subset Size for Minimum Covariance Determinant Estimation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person("Chikun", "Li", role = "aut"),
             person("Baisuo", "Jin", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                    email = "jbs@ustc.edu.cn"))
Description: Selects the initial subset size using ordered squared Mahalanobis
    distances along a projection-depth ordering and computes reweighted
    location and scatter estimates. Includes scripts for selected figures
    and tables in the accompanying manuscript.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: ddalpha, robustbase, stats
Suggests: data.table, digest, ggplot2 (>= 3.5.0), grid, MASS, parallel,
    fsdac, StableMCD
NeedsCompilation: no
